# DESK02 -- Options -> Set preferences..., change "Date format" to DMY, OK,
# then Options -> Save desktop..., on the base image.
# Menu geometry (kernel/src/desk/menu.rs adjust_menu, active_x = 2*8 = 16):
#   Desk 16..64, File 64..112, View 112..160, Options 160..232.
#   Options box entry n at y = 19 + n*16; entry 6 = "Set preferences..."
#   (y 115..131), entry 11 = "Save desktop..." (y 195..211).
# Preferences dialog: 382x212, form_center -> (129, 143) (measured on the
# probe run). Group column gx = 24 + 20*8 = 184, buttons 22 px tall centred
# on a 16 px label row (offset -3).
#   "DMY" = 129+184+62 .. +56, 143+125 .. +22  -> centre (403, 279)
#   "OK"  = 129+91 .. +90,      143+160 .. +28 -> centre (265, 317)
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 196 8
1800 mark B_OPTIONS_OPEN
2100 move 200 123
2300 down
2303 up
2600 parkbr
3000 mark C_PREFS
3300 move 403 279
3500 down
3503 up
3800 parkbr
4200 mark D_DMY
4500 move 265 317
4700 down
4703 up
5000 parkbr
5400 mark E_CLOSED
5700 move 196 8
6100 move 200 203
6300 down
6303 up
6600 parkbr
7000 mark F_SAVED
